  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eyYq/211",
  "contentHtml": "<p>#4계절 #식생지수 #가이아 #사막 #지구온난화 #자전축 #공전<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><p>지구가 숨쉬는 동안에, 변화가 없는 사막지역도 보이네요.</p><p>하지만, 사막에서도</p><p>이 자료에는 보이지 않는 수많은 생명이 숨 쉬고 있겠죠?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b1db5e626dcc6f059e5f844821c5be259a6dd9e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"727\" height=\"404\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b1db5e626dcc6f059e5f844821c5be259a6dd9e\" data-origin-width=\"338\" data-origin-height=\"188\"></div><p>NASA의 Terra 위성에 탑재된 MODIS(중해상도 이미징 분광복사계)에서 가져온 데이터라고 합니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://modis.gsfc.nasa.gov/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">MODIS Web (nasa.gov)</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv3affft9c4fp11qnzg0c9ww2@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv3affft9c4fp11qnzg0c9ww2/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33279042556&amp;signature=ltCE%2F23VcsM8lH%2BAiVKLJ9rAzkw%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv3affft9c4fp11qnzg0c9ww2?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2M2FmZmZ0OWM0ZnAxMXFuemcwYzl3dzIiLCJ0aWQiOiJjMDNhMzJmMi0wODY4LTRlYTEtYWJiZS0wYzAwNzQ5MmYwNTkiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODkyMDJ9.57KnD01jCeM-XU_551LTRG4-KTRZ7ZnNPDnZaPiq82ZrC1pWYGgGfGmeUPifPs2-zcKoilJmFybZaM3kFofklQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>출처: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1107519836992257\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">동영상 | Facebook</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"로그인 또는 가입하여 보기\" data-og-description=\"Facebook에서 게시물, 사진 등을 확인하세요.\" data-og-host=\"www.facebook.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1107519836992257\" data-og-url=\"https://www.facebook.com/login/?next=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FNASAHistoryOffice%2Fvideos%2Fndvi-20002019%2F1107519836992257%2F\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1107519836992257\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=1107519836992257\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">로그인 또는 가입하여 보기</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Facebook에서 게시물, 사진 등을 확인하세요.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.facebook.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
